```bash
python3 scripts/orchestration/check_preflight.py
python3 scripts/orchestration/check_agent_consistency.py
```

## Operating model

Every non-trivial task follows:

`Plan -> Packet -> Isolated execution -> Verification -> Review -> Promotion`

## Hard constraints

- No direct production mutations
- No direct secret handling unless task explicitly requires it
- No cloud/remote agent execution for sensitive work
- No autonomous merge claims
